---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { BOOKING_URL } from '../config';
import joeFord from '../assets/proof/joe-ford.jpg';
---
<Layout
  title="About — Goliath Solutions | Built by an Operator, Not an Agency"
  description="Joe Ford spent 14 years running real businesses — and is a partner in a pool company he ranked to #1 on Google — before building Goliath Solutions for the trades."
>
  <section class="bg-navy px-5 py-20 text-center text-white sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto size-28 overflow-hidden rounded-full ring-4 ring-cyan/40">
      <Image src={joeFord} alt="Joe Ford, founder of Goliath Solutions" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
    </div>
    <h1 class="mt-6 font-black tracking-[-0.02em]" style="font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 60px)">Built by an operator,<br /><span class="text-cyan">not an agency.</span></h1>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-white/75">Most marketing companies are run by marketers. This one is run by a guy who's answered the phone at dinner and made payroll on a Friday.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl space-y-5 px-5 py-16 text-[18px] leading-relaxed text-ink">
    <p>I'm Joe Ford. I've spent the last 14 years running real businesses — hiring crews, chasing invoices, answering the phone at dinner, and learning the hard way what actually brings work in the door.</p>
    <p>One of those businesses is <span class="font-semibold text-navy">Florida's Best Pools</span>, a 40-year family pool company in South Florida I'm a partner in. Great work, great crew — and, for a while, almost invisible on Google. I watched operators all around me hand agencies $2,000 a month for "SEO reports" that never once made the phone ring.</p>
    <p>So I stopped hiring agencies and built the system myself — website, local SEO, Google profile, reviews — for my own company first. Today Florida's Best Pools sits at <span class="font-semibold text-navy">#1 on Google in its market with 200 five-star reviews</span>, pulling 60+ organic calls a month without buying a single click. Then friends in the trades started asking me to do the same for them.</p>
    <p>That became Goliath Solutions. One package that handles the whole online side of a service business — website, local SEO, Google Business, reviews, Local Service Ads — for a price a working company can actually justify.</p>
    <p>No account managers in a ticket queue. No jargon reports. No 12-month contract to trap you. You deal with me, you see the real numbers, and if we're not earning our keep, you walk — month to month. The risk is on my side of the table, where it belongs.</p>
    <p class="font-bold text-navy">Great work deserves to be found. Let's make sure yours is.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-line bg-mist px-5 py-16 text-center">
    <h2 class="font-black tracking-[-0.01em] text-navy" style="font-size: clamp(28px, 4.5vw, 40px)">Tell me where it hurts.</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-mute">The first call is free and useful — even if you never hire us. You'll leave with a plan either way.</p>
    <a href={BOOKING_URL} class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-gold px-7 py-3.5 font-bold text-navy transition hover:bg-gold-deep hover:text-white">Book a free call <Icon name="arrow" size={16} /></a>
  </section>
</Layout>
